### Create Location
POST http://localhost:3000/location
Content-Type: application/json

{
 "locationName": "Downtown Branchs",
  "address": "4567 Center St, City, State",
  "contactNumber": "25"
}

### Get all Locations
GET http://localhost:3000/location

### Get Location by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/location/2

### Update Location
PATCH http://localhost:3000/location/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
"address": "789 New St, City, State"
}

### Delete Location
DELETE http://localhost:3000/location/3


###################################
## MAINTENANCE Endpoints
###################################

### Create Maintenance Record
POST http://localhost:3000/maintenance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "carId": 1,
  "description": "Oil change",
  "maintenanceDate": "2026-03-01",
  "cost": 50.00
}

### Get all Maintenance Records
GET http://localhost:3000/maintenance

### Get Maintenance by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/maintenance/1

### Get Maintenance by Car ID
GET http://localhost:3000/maintenance/car/1

### Update Maintenance
PATCH http://localhost:3000/maintenance/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
"cost": 55.00
}

####  Delete Maintenance
DELETE http://localhost:3000/maintenance/1
